<title>SPAIN: Bankinter cuts prime rate to 5.50 pct.</title>
<headline>Bankinter cuts prime rate to 5.50 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Bankinter said on Tuesday it was cutting its prime rate to 5.50 percent from 5.75 percent, following the Bank of Spain's 25 basis point cut in its key money rate.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
